@gideon.sato Draft Hartford incident summary for Mateo's procurement team (from #inc-vtg-hartford, Aug 3, 2026):

Gate kiosks at Vantorre's Hartford plant went offline. Both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan, so guards checked trucks in on paper. First reported at 10:42 AM. Kiosk 1 came back at 11:03 AM, when trailer 8836 was checked in and dispatch could see it. Both lanes were confirmed working at 11:07 AM. Carrowmere Cloud was checking the Hartford gateway route, and the incident stays open for another arrival cycle. Separate issue: status-page access for Mateo's account is still being chased under INC-4821.

Times are as posted in the incident room. Let me know if you want them in a different time zone or format before it goes to procurement.
